        {
          "text": "ababa mu mugamba bose, uhereye i Lebanoni ugashitsa i Misirefoti‐mayimu, ni bo Basidoni bose; at’ Abo nzotuma biruka imbere y’Abisirayeli; ariko wewe, pfa kuhagabanganya Abisirayeli, nk’uko nakugeze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
